silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_01_storage_as_leg_sections_01_storage_not_identity_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In 'StorageNotIdentityYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, The universal mediator u: Mittens -> VetCarePlan_77 is the concrete competing cocone target that receives Mittens through compatible legs. GraniteRow_Mittens does not have this arrow." .
